        "id": "2085123371776516096",
        "title": "Good evals are boring",
        "preview_text": "You traced your agent, are collecting user feedback, have identified some metrics you'd like to evaluate. But how? What kind of evaluator do you need? How do you translate the metric you want to",
        "cover_media": {
          "id": "QXBpTWVkaWE6DAAFCgABHO/i2HeaIAEKAAILr4VT8xZwAAAA",
          "media_id": "2085134571843231745",
          "media_info": {
            "__typename": "ApiImage",
            "color_info": {
              "palette": [
